    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>Why Teams Are Moving Toward Active Intelligence</h2>
  <p>
    As organizations grow, the cost of communication overhead scales exponentially. Teams that preserve their context through active AI tools move faster, make fewer duplicate errors, and onboard new talent in days rather than months.
  </p>
  <p>
    To learn how your team can eliminate context fragmentation and retain institutional memory, explore <a href="/nexus-ai" class="text-accent-700 font-semibold underline">Nexus AI by Aixentrix</a> or join the <a href="https://app.aixentrix.com/?auth=signup" class="text-accent-700 font-semibold underline">free public beta</a> today.
  </p>
</BlogPostLayout>
